        "id": 1132614
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-08-08T20:39:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given the classic address and the le address shouldn\u0027t be the same, and if LE only is at play then classic address connected would be false in which case it would attempt to remove the device.  and then in the case of LE if it isn\u0027t then we would in fact call it a second time.  good catch.  This should likely be just consolidated into a single call after the logic.",
